@startuml 04_deployment
' One daemon process on a single host. Names are generic on purpose.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55

node "Client machine or same host" as ClientNode {
  artifact "Agent client\n(harness)" as Agent
  artifact "Browser\n(dashboard)" as Browser
}

node "Inference host" as Host {
  node "anemoi-daemon process" as DaemonProc {
    artifact "HTTP API" as Api
    artifact "Reconciliation loop" as Reconcile
    artifact "Staging loop" as StagingLoop
  }
  artifact "Policy config\n(YAML)" as Config
  artifact "Governance overrides\n(optional JSON file)" as Overrides
  database "Decision log\n(memory, JSONL or SQLite)" as Store
  node "llama-swap" as Swap {
    artifact "llama-server\n(model processes)" as Server
  }
  node "GPU" as Gpu
}

Agent --> Api : HTTP
Browser --> Api : HTTP

DaemonProc ..> Config : reads at start
DaemonProc ..> Overrides : reads and writes
DaemonProc --> Store
Reconcile --> Swap : inspect: /health, /v1/models,\n/metrics, /api/events (SSE)
Api --> Swap : forwards /v1/chat/completions\n(only with live-execute gate)
StagingLoop --> Swap : load_model\n(only with live-execute gate)
Server --> Gpu

note bottom of Swap
  A client that calls llama-swap directly bypasses
  Anemoi: none of its governance applies to that traffic.
end note
@enduml
